{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>V1 release</strong>: This demo version includes the<strong> first 2 levels</strong>, and<strong> 2 side challenge levels</strong> of<strong>\u00a0<i>SHEEP</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">*** No sound, but demo will be updated to include music/sounds before game release</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>SHEEP </strong>is a<strong> challenging, surreal first-person herding adventure</strong> that takes you through pastures, mountains, space, and pocket dimensions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706470/extras/EnterCaveShort.gif?t=1746346543\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udc11 Lead Your Flock \u2013 Control Woolsworth to guide your flock. Use clever movement and positioning to solve puzzles and traverse treacherous terrain.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf00 Gain Magic Abilities - Find hidden crystals to unlock powerful new moves</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2694\ufe0f Challenging encounters - Fast-paced fights that reward sharp reflexes and clever use of your surroundings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf0d Explore the Surreal - From grassy hills to rainy chasms, lava caverns, and starry arenas\u2014each level is a strange new world with its own secrets and threats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udcd6 Uncover Hidden Realms - Secret access points transport you to six optional levels full of traps, puzzles, and battles\u2014including a chaotic finale.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">**All side levels include a built in timer and best time bulletin board.<strong> WELCOME SPEEDRUNNERS!</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfb6 Original Soundtrack - Let a playful, emotional score carry you through each strange new world<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706470/extras/Entity.gif?t=17463465